guide forever/reputation/thunder-bluff
title Thunder Bluff Reputation
category Reputation
faction Horde
levels 12-60
zone Thunder Bluff
# Built from the Era-baseline reference data: Rumstag Proudstrider, the Thunder Bluff
# cloth quartermaster, and the cloth quests 7820/7821/7822/7823 (one-time) and 7825
# (Additional Runecloth, repeatable) from quests.json; cloth farm spots are
# the densest spawn clusters of strong cloth droppers in items.json/npcs.json.
# Nothing public shows Forever changing the cloth donations; this has NOT been
# play-tested on Forever yet. Refine it with Polestar_Recorder sessions.
#
# The client never flags a repeatable quest as completed, so the Additional
# Runecloth steps finish on the Thunder Bluff standing (rep 81); each
# step's optional `turnin 7825 direct` checks off at its first hand-in. Cloth counts (60 per first donation, 20 per repeat) are game
# knowledge: the data only has the 60 Runecloth of A Donation of Runecloth.

step Rumstag Proudstrider: A Donation of Wool
  tip Rumstag Proudstrider takes cloth for Thunder Bluff in Thunder Bluff. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains.
  level 12
  accept 7820

step Wool Cloth
  zone The Barrens
  tip Venture Co. Enforcers at the Boulder Lode Mine (level 16-17) drop it here. The Auction House works too.
  collect 2592 x60 quest 7820.1 @61,4.2

step Rumstag Proudstrider: A Donation of Silk
  zone Thunder Bluff
  turnin 7820
  level 26
  accept 7821

step Silk Cloth
  zone Desolace
  tip Kolkar centaur (level 30-33) drop it here. The Auction House works too.
  collect 4306 x60 quest 7821.1 @72.4,47.1

step Rumstag Proudstrider: A Donation of Mageweave
  zone Thunder Bluff
  turnin 7821
  level 40
  accept 7822

step Mageweave Cloth
  zone Tanaris
  tip Dunemaul ogres (level 45-48) drop it here. The Auction House works too.
  collect 4338 x60 quest 7822.1 @40.1,54.4

step Rumstag Proudstrider: A Donation of Runecloth
  zone Thunder Bluff
  turnin 7822
  level 50
  accept 7823

step Runecloth
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) drop it here; every Scourge kill here also counts toward the Argent Dawn (see that guide). The Auction House works too.
  collect 14047 x60 quest 7823.1 @40,51.3

step Rumstag Proudstrider: Runecloth delivered
  zone Thunder Bluff
  turnin 7823

step Additional Runecloth to Honored
  tip Additional Runecloth takes 20 Runecloth per turn-in and repeats as often as you like. Bring Runecloth in multiples of 20 and hand them all in at once, one turn-in after another. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House.
  collect 14047 x20 optional @40,51.3 map 1423
  turnin 7825 direct optional
  rep 81 Honored

step Additional Runecloth to Revered
  tip Keep handing in Additional Runecloth, 20 Runecloth at a time. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House.
  collect 14047 x20 optional @40,51.3 map 1423
  turnin 7825 direct optional
  rep 81 Revered

step Additional Runecloth to Exalted
  tip Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Thunder Bluff is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House.
  collect 14047 x20 optional @40,51.3 map 1423
  turnin 7825 direct optional
  rep 81 Exalted
